          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a]">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] mb-1">XML Conversion</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed mb-2">
              Bridge SOAP endpoints, RSS feeds, and legacy enterprise payloads into lightweight modern JSON.
            </p>
            <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
              <a href="/convert/xml-to-json" class="underline font-semibold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2]">xml to json</a>
              <span>•</span>
              <a href="/convert/json-to-xml" class="underline font-semibold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2]">json to xml</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a]">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] mb-1">CSV Conversion</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed mb-2">
